            <ArticleTitle>Buprenorphine for chronic pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>402-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3109/15360288.2013.847522</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Questions from patients about pain conditions, analgesic pharmacotherapy and responses from authors are presented to help educate patients and make them more effective self-advocates. The use of transdermal buprenorphine for chronic pain management is discussed. A brief history of the medication is provided. The use of the medication in opioid maintenance, and withdrawal and other concerns are discussed. Possible side effects are described.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
